<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Casinos Austria makes a loss in 1996.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Casinos Austria makes a loss in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		loss 4.91 vs profit 2.71</p>
<p>    Net				loss 18.47 vs profit 1.58</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)		nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales				   79.62 vs 53.01</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		 loss 15.20 vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Casinos Austria International Ltd is the international subsidiary of Vienna-based  Casino Austria AG.  </p>
<p>Casinos Austria International said the abnormal loss reflected the write-down of its investment in Reef Casino Trust .</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
